<title>USA: Cass Cty, Mich., won by Seattle-Northwest.</title>
<headline>Cass Cty, Mich., won by Seattle-Northwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Sec Corp., said it won $3.030 million of Cass Cty, Mich., general obligation Cass Cty sanitary sewer system limited tax bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.276 percent.</p>
